    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοκνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shrink from</i>, c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως . . μὴ κατοκνήσεις κτανεῖν
					Αἴγισθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					956
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὀρθοῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mochl.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. γῆν περιιδεῖν τμηθεῖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ κατόκνει . . πορεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.19
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν στρατείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mith.</u>
					110
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>shrink back</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				29.1
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>to be sluggish</i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ δυνάμει κ. [ἡ ψυχή</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.30
			</span></i> K.</div>
